    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just like a \"tough day\" though. it’s like... every day is the same. i look at my life and i just don't see the value in it anymore. like, if i just stopped trying, if i just disappeared, would anything actually change? or would everyone just be better off without the burden of me?",
